 url←GetBaseURL request;host;scheme;secure
⍝ Returns the absolute base URL the current request came in on, for example "https://tatin.dev".
⍝ Returns an empty vector in case the request does not carry a "host" header.
⍝ "x-forwarded-proto" is honoured so that the result is correct behind a reverse proxy as well.
 url←''
 :If 0<≢host←'host'GetFromHeaders request.Headers
     :If 0=≢scheme←'x-forwarded-proto'GetFromHeaders request.Headers
         secure←⊃0 G.INI.Get'CONFIG:Secure'
         scheme←'http','s'/⍨1=secure
     :EndIf
     url←scheme,'://',host
 :EndIf
⍝Done
